      "summary_sent_score": 0.28777876496315
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "According to the petitioner, he had a valid licence and No Objection Certificate from the concerned authority for running the meat shop under the Food Safety and Standards Act,\n2006.",
