      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3437841534614563
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Now it is not being renewed by the respondents, for which no reasons have been assigned.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 561,
      "end": 650,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15629179775714874
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Let the counter affidavit be filed within a period of three weeks.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 651,
      "end": 718,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12522566318511963
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "List this matter after three weeks in the daily cause list.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 720,
      "end": 779,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17892514169216156
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "Meanwhile, the respondents are directed to give a provisional renewal of the licence to the petitioner which shall be subject to the final determination in the writ petition.",
